*1 [[Dark Otter]] spawns after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>, delay 20~30 seconds<sup>600f~900f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Gory Dark]]s spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 30~40 seconds<sup>900f~1,200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Trolly Blogger]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 30~40 seconds<sup>900f~1,200f</sup>.
